SNOMED CT
---------
This repository references SNOMED CT concepts by bare concept identifier only
(e.g. http://snomed.info/id/430725003), attached to our own labels via
skos:exactMatch. It contains no SNOMED CT descriptions, relationships or
release files. SNOMED CT is a registered trademark of SNOMED International.
Use of SNOMED CT content requires a licence (in the US, via the NLM UMLS
Metathesaurus License). The app shows its own labels next to each code.
Edition referenced: SNOMED CT US 2026_03_01.

Clinical rules
--------------
The contraindication rules in backend/kg/conditions.ttl are derived from
published guidelines and are marked review_status "unreviewed". They are not
medical advice and require clinician sign-off before any real use.

Data
----
All member data in this repository is synthetic.
